# TopShelfWebsites.com Contact Form Setup Guidelines
# Controller: Avatar Sales Director (#2)

## 🌐 1. Front-End Integration Point
The HTML contact form on the live site must point directly to your deployed Cloudflare Worker endpoint link.

## 📋 2. Required Input Fields
* `name`: Full text name or business name of the client inquirer.
* `email`: Active contact address (For direct follow-ups from Avatar #2).
* `message`: Project goals, budget limits, or target timeline parameters.

## 🛑 3. Verification Protocol
* All incoming data triggers are evaluated by the backend worker logic to filter out empty strings and duplicate submissions.
